---
const sample = `{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 1,
  "method": "tools/list",
  "params": {}
}`;
---

<div class="list-workbench" data-mcp-validator>
  <div class="workbench-bar">
    <strong>MCP JSON-RPC validator</strong>
    <div>
      <button type="button" data-mcp-clear>Clear</button>
      <button type="button" data-mcp-copy disabled>Copy report</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="tool-guidance">
    <div>
      <strong>What should I paste?</strong>
      <p>Copy one JSON message from MCP Inspector, an SDK test, or a client/server debug log. You can also paste a single tool definition from a <code>tools/list</code> response. Remove secrets before using any debugging tool.</p>
    </div>
    <label class="list-select-field">
      <span>Load an example</span>
      <select data-mcp-example>
        <option value="tools-list-request">tools/list request</option>
        <option value="tools-list-response">tools/list response</option>
        <option value="tool-definition">Single tool definition</option>
        <option value="tools-call-request">tools/call request</option>
      </select>
    </label>
  </div>
  <div class="list-panes">
    <label>
      <span>Paste one MCP JSON message</span>
      <textarea rows="16" maxlength="1000000" spellcheck="false" data-mcp-input>{sample}</textarea>
    </label>
    <label>
      <span>What the validator found</span>
      <textarea rows="16" readonly spellcheck="false" data-mcp-output></textarea>
    </label>
  </div>
  <div class="list-options list-options-simple">
    <p data-mcp-status aria-live="polite">Ready</p>
    <button class="toolbox-button toolbox-button-small" type="button" data-mcp-validate>Check JSON structure</button>
  </div>
</div>
